SPLIT R:EXTRA-L1-0032 | a: Every security-scan report states the static-analysis limitation. | b: Reports use the five-level severity scale Critical (sparingly) / High / Medium / Low / Info. | c: Each confirmed finding gives severity, file and location, title, evidence, why it is a risk, likely impact, smallest remediation and OWASP category when applicable. | d: The report contains scope, limitations, a severity summary table, findings and per-layer results.
